=== HYPOTHESIS ===
# p_8c2d — Yuki's Short Afternoon Errand: Keys Out Only 14:30–16:00

The p_a1b2 claim that Yuki's keys are out of the house for the entire 14:00–22:00 window went against twice (keys sighted in the house) while also earning three weak-for hits (entry table empty). The most parsimonious reading: Yuki leaves for a short errand around 14:30, is back by 16:00, and her keys return to the entry table. She is home for dinner (the robot saw her in the kitchen at 20:00) and in the living room at 22:00.

This document differs from p_c9d4 (which puts Yuki out 13:00–17:30) and from p_a1b2 (which implies she is out the whole afternoon) by compressing her absence into a roughly 90-minute window. Her jacket, sunglasses, and water bottle follow the same short pattern. The water bottle in particular stays at the dish rack for most of the day — the 18:00 and 22:00 passes both confirm it there.

Refutation: if keys_yuki is sighted in the house at 15:00 on a weekday, the errand window is wrong. If the keys are found out of the house at 17:00 or later, the window is too short.

```json
